	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/vr_hands/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Aiming with the controller, your hands: with arms\nfrom the shoulders, floating, or the game's arms."/>
		<string text="The left grip holds a long gun by its foregrip:\nit aims along the line between your hands."/>
		<string text="Near an enemy your aim is slow to leave it, and\nzoomed, it is drawn gently toward it."/>
		<string text="Smart-link: the turning stick's click zooms on your\nvisor. At the eye: raise the scope to your eye."/>
		<string text="Reach over your right shoulder for a long gun, or\nto your right hip for a pistol, and grip to draw it."/>
		<string text="Take a magazine from your left hip and push it\nin: loaded at once. X still reloads."/>
		<string text="A hard swing of the right controller melees, as\nB does; with its grip held, a softer one will do."/>
		<string text="Hand: hold the left grip, draw the hand back, swing\nand let go. Both: or the left trigger. Trigger: only it."/>
		<string text="How strongly the controllers feel each weapon\nfiring, and the hits on you."/>
		<string text="Punching, parrying and deflecting shots, pulling a\nweapon to you, passing it across, holding and throwing."/>
	</strings>
